Relatório para o adversário.

585
00:32:39.286 --> 00:32:40.753
Sim o senhor.

586
00:32:40.788 --> 00:32:42.847
Boa sorte .

587
00:32:42.890 --> 00:32:44.858
Para todos nós.

588
00:32:52.533 --> 00:32:54.364
Desligue os runabouts.

589
00:33:09.550 --> 00:33:11.780
Runabout Yukon, prepare-se para a partida.

590
